屋の片付けとかこまめにできる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎私も、自分の部屋の片付けは後回しにして、他の部屋の片付けを先にしてしまいます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆しんやさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんは浅い友達がたくさんと深い仲の友達が少しだったらどっちがいいの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎うーん、深い仲の友達がいいかな。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、実際は\n浅い仲の友達の割合が多いかも。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんはいないけど！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆なべちゃんさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁ラーメンはすすれるようになったかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎それが、まだなってないの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね！玲香さんもすすれない族だったの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆埼玉のダルビッシュさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁まいちゅんって納豆食べる時ご飯もセット？\n納豆だけで食べてるの？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎ご飯がある環境だと、一膳に満たないくらいの白米に対し、納豆3パックくらいで食べてるけど、白米がない環境だと納豆1パック食べるのをみかけるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆松たかしさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁クイズ王の古川さんが昨日カラオケの採点で『ひとりよがり』で１００点出したんですよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"t